                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUM EMPFANGEN UND SENDEN EINES REFERENZSIGNALS UND COMPUTERLESBARES SPEICHERMEDIUM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE RÉCEPTION ET D'ÉMISSION DE SIGNAL DE RÉFÉRENCE, ET SUPPORT DE STOCKAGE LISIBLE PAR ORDINATEUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND DEVICE FOR RECEIVING AND SENDING REFERENCE SIGNAL, AND COMPUTER-READABLE STORAGE MEDIUM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided are devices and methods for sending and receiving a reference signal, and the device for sending a reference signal comprises a second processor (401) and a second memory (402), where the second processor (401) is configured to execute a program stored in the second memory (402) to implement the following: determining (201) a reference signal resource used for sending the reference signal and sending (202) the reference signal by using the determined reference signal resource.</p>
            </abstract>
